caption: High Magic Advancement
tradition-component: high-magic-advancement

High Magic advancement is divided into ordinary specialization advantages and three independent Mastery-gated Tradition Path families. Safer Flagrant Displays, Yin Master, Yang Master, Elemental Master, and Animal Mastery are specialization advantages. The Embodiments are Path commitments: Aspect (Yin, Yang, or Balance), Element, and Animal. Each Path family is mutually exclusive within itself, but selections from different families are compatible. A High Mage may therefore eventually possess one Aspect Path, one Element Path, and one Animal Path.
